      <div class="how-it-works-grid">
        <div class="how-step">
          <div class="how-icon">🔧</div>
          <h3>Cable Installation</h3>
          <p>High-strength steel cables are laid in precise patterns before concrete pour, encased in protective sheathing.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="how-step">
          <div class="how-icon">🏗️</div>
          <h3>Concrete Pour</h3>
          <p>Concrete is poured around the unstressed cables, creating a monolithic slab with embedded tensioning system.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="how-step">
          <div class="how-icon">⚡</div>
          <h3>Tensioning Process</h3>
          <p>After concrete cures, hydraulic jacks stretch the cables to precise tension, compressing the concrete from within.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="how-step">
          <div class="how-icon">🛡️</div>
          <h3>Permanent Compression</h3>
          <p>The tensioned cables maintain continuous compression, preventing cracks and providing superior structural integrity.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

